  "slug": "rtl-chat",
  "name": "Rtl Chat",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Ensures Claude's chat responses are properly formatted for Hebrew RTL (right-to-left) text, especially when mixing Hebrew and English. Handles bidirectional text formatting so responses look clean and readable instead of jumbled. Should be active on every response when the conversation includes Hebrew text.",
